<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Special Circumstances Application</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        body {
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        td {
            padding: 5px 0;
        }
        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .form-row > div {
            width: 48%;
        }
        .section-header {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .checkbox-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .checkbox-group input[type="checkbox"] {
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        .line-item-table td:first-child {
            width: 50%;
        }
        .line-item-table td:last-child {
            text-align: right;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;">COLLEGE OF</div>
        <div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold;">Saint Benedict</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px;">Saint John's University</div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="text-align: center;">2022-2023 Special Circumstances Application</h2>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 15px;">STUDENT INFORMATION</h3>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <label>Last Name:</label>
                <br>
                <span data-field="full_name_last">{{ full_name_last }}</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <label>First Name:</label>
                <br>
                <span data-field="full_name_first">{{ full_name_first }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <label>Parent's Name(s):</label>
                <br>
                <span data-field="parent_names">{{ parent_names }}</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <label>M.I.:</label>
                <br>
                <span data-field="middle_initial">{{ middle_initial }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <label>Parent email address:</label>
                <br>
                <span data-field="parent_email">{{ parent_email }}</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <label>Banner ID: (if known)</label>
                <br>
                <span data-field="banner_id">{{ banner_id }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div>
                <label>Parent daytime phone number:</label>
                <br>
                <span data-field="parent_phone">{{ parent_phone }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">REASON FOR FILING</div>
    <p>Please provide the required documentation based on your reason for filing this request. Failure to submit necessary documentation will delay processing.</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="checkbox-group">
            <input type="checkbox">
            <label>Private Elementary/Secondary School Tuition</label>
        </div>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
            <input type="checkbox">
            <label>Marital Separation/Divorce (After filing FAFSA)</label>
        </div>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
            <input type="checkbox">
            <label>Loss of Employment/Reduced Wages</label>
        </div>
        <div class="checkbox-group">
            <input type="checkbox">
            <label>Other</label>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <p>Parents must live in separate residences.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">REQUIRED DOCUMENTATION</div>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>Tuition statement OR letter from the school indicating tuition charges minus financial aid and/or discounts for child(ren) at school.</li>
        <li>If parents are divorced/separated, and the non-custodial parent provides assistance toward the private tuition at an elementary/secondary school, provide a statement indicating the amount of assistance.</li>
        <li>Documentation of separation, divorce or verification of separate residences</li>
        <li>Written statement identifying the custodial parent. Provide the names, ages and the relationship of the family members that the custodial parent will support through the year.</li>
        <li>Amount of child support to be received or anticipated by custodial parent.</li>
        <li>Signed copy of 2020 federal tax return</li>
        <li>Most recent pay stub(s) from previous/current employer for parents</li>
        <li>Letter from previous/current employer stating date of employment</li>
        <li>Benefit or denial letter from unemployment</li>
        <li>Severance information (if any)</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="section-header">ESTIMATED INCOME CHART (For Loss of Employment/Reduced Wages)</div>

    <table class="line-item-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 50%;">Description</td>
                <td style="width: 25%; text-align: center;">January 1, 2021 - December 31, 2021</td>
                <td style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">January 1, 2022 - December 31, 2022</td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Parent 1 gross income from work (wages, salary, tips, etc.)</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_p1_2021">{{ estimated_income_p1_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_p1_2022">{{ estimated_income_p1_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Parent 2 gross income from work (wages, salary, tips, etc.)</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_p2_2021">{{ estimated_income_p2_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_p2_2022">{{ estimated_income_p2_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Interest and/or dividend income</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_interest_2021">{{ estimated_income_interest_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_interest_2022">{{ estimated_income_interest_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Business/Farm income</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_business_2021">{{ estimated_income_business_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_business_2022">{{ estimated_income_business_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Unemployment Compensation ($ for <span data-field="unemployment_weeks">{{ unemployment_weeks }}</span> weeks)</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_unemployment_2021">{{ estimated_income_unemployment_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_unemployment_2022">{{ estimated_income_unemployment_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Severance Pay</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_severance_2021">{{ estimated_income_severance_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_severance_2022">{{ estimated_income_severance_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Capital gains</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_capital_gains_2021">{{ estimated_income_capital_gains_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_capital_gains_2022">{{ estimated_income_capital_gains_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Spousal maintenance</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_spousal_maintenance_2021">{{ estimated_income_spousal_maintenance_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_spousal_maintenance_2022">{{ estimated_income_spousal_maintenance_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Child support received</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_child_support_2021">{{ estimated_income_child_support_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_child_support_2022">{{ estimated_income_child_support_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Taxable social security benefits</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_ss_benefits_2021">{{ estimated_income_ss_benefits_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_ss_benefits_2022">{{ estimated_income_ss_benefits_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Worker's compensation</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_workers_comp_2021">{{ estimated_income_workers_comp_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_workers_comp_2022">{{ estimated_income_workers_comp_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Short-term or Long-term disability benefits</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_disability_2021">{{ estimated_income_disability_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_disability_2022">{{ estimated_income_disability_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Withdrawal from retirement account</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_retirement_2021">{{ estimated_income_retirement_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_retirement_2022">{{ estimated_income_retirement_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Other income (pension/annuity, rental income, housing allowance, bonuses, etc)</td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_other_2021">{{ estimated_income_other_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="estimated_income_other_2022">{{ estimated_income_other_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
        <tfoot>
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: right;">Total Estimated Income</td>
                <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="total_estimated_income_2021">{{ total_estimated_income_2021 }}</span></td>
                <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="total_estimated_income_2022">{{ total_estimated_income_2022 }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tfoot>
    </table>

    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">Continued on back</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="margin-top: 0;">
        <div class="section-header">SIGNATURES</div>
        <p>By signing below, you certify that the information provided on the CSB/SJU Special Circumstances Application is complete and correct. In accordance with federal regulations, if you purposely give false or misleading information on the FAFSA or Verification Worksheet, you may be fined, sentenced to jail or both.</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <div class="form-row" style="justify-content: space-between;">
                <div>
                    <label>Parent Signature (typed signature will not be accepted)</label>
                    <br>
                    <span data-field="parent_signature_line">{{ parent_signature_line }}</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label>Date</label>
                    <br>
                    <span data-field="signature_date">{{ signature_date }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 60px;">
        <p>Return this form and documentation to:</p>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
            <div style="width: 48%;">
                <p>Women:</p>
                <p>College of Saint Benedict</p>
                <p>Financial Aid Office</p>
                <p>37 South College Avenue</p>
                <p>Saint Joseph, MN 56374</p>
                <p>Fax: (320) 363-6090</p>
                <p>E-mail: <span data-field="csb_email">{{ csb_email }}</span></p>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 48%;">
                <p>Men:</p>
                <p>Saint John's University</p>
                <p>Financial Aid Office</p>
                <p>2850 Abbey Plaza</p>
                <p>Collegeville, MN 56321</p>
                <p>Fax: (320) 363-3102</p>
                <p>E-mail: <span data-field="sju_email">{{ sju_email }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
        <p>Secure Upload option available at <a href="{{ secure_upload_link }}">{{ secure_upload_link }}</a></p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>